$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Avicord's Planet" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle for each others flag on Avicord's Planet. Beware of the possible ambush from the surounding trees. Quick thinking and taking control of the enemies base is the key to victory! The first team with ten captures shall be granted victory!\n\n<f1>Map by: <f0>Lord Mycroft\n<f1>Email: <f0>mycroft@LanMinds.Net";